------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code: ArchAI (MIT License)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Parts of the JSON tool protocol are adapted from ArchAI, a HackApertus 2026 project
(https://github.com/kirtanp/hackpertus-archives, commit d22b5e601d5f93bb55c96a347ce5f3ff3426758f):

  src/llm/tool_protocol/parse.py      adapted from src/archai/llm.py (extract_json)
  src/llm/tool_protocol/validate.py   adapted from src/archai/agent.py (repair_args)
  src/llm/tool_protocol/protocol.py   run_tools follows src/archai/agent.py (run_record_v4)
  eval/tool_bench/cases.py, score.py  adapted from src/archai/tool_bench.py
  eval/tool_bench/run.py              native call extraction and the thread-pool runner
                                      adapted from src/archai/tool_bench.py (_calls_native, main)

The adapted parts were changed (see the header of each file). ArchAI's licence:

